（物体或场景的潜在含义）\n\n\n\n2．输出时请先给出一段完整的中文版本，\n3．整篇描述务必使用丰富的形容词与具体数值、相对尺寸（如 “人物占画面竖直高度的约 1/3”，“光线来自画面左上方 45 度”），帮助 AI 尽可能精准地还原画面细节。\n\n4．如果对某些细节缺乏确定性，可作合理推断并在描述中标明为 “可能” 或 “推测”，但请尽量给出具体化的数值或范围。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 64, "type": "SeargePromptText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SeargePromptText"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [98], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [210, 46], "pos": [5550.05517578125, -403.6539306640625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 83, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 84, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 72, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.26", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 43}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [84], "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [210, 58], "pos": [5555.51611328125, -297.94805908203125], "widgets_values": ["ae.sft"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 73, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.26", "widget_ue_connectable": {"vae_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [95], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [157.6741485595703, 27.433502197265625], "pos": [5002.958984375, -304.6836242675781], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 85, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {}, "id": 74, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": 